# tools/estimates/l5d-probe.diff — the L5d probe (#301): a scratch-tree patch, never applied to main.
# Re-run: git worktree add /tmp/p HEAD && cd /tmp/p && git apply tools/estimates/l5d-probe.diff &&
#   for P in P1 P2 P3 P4; do PROBE=$P node tools/m0.js cov > cov-$P.txt; done   (and once without PROBE: the baseline)
# P1 the model forced on, nothing scanned; P2 every zone revealed once at t = 0, aims by the model;
# P3 every zone re-revealed every step (the model = the truth); P4 plan advancement by the model with knowledge on (item 45 (a)).
# Compare each COV line's verdict and rows with the baseline's ("rows":"same" = the record's rows unchanged).
